# Specification: native visual method integration

The maintainer authorizes evaluating and adapting useful external visual skills.
Library acceptance is independent from native product acceptance.

- REQ-01: Evaluate each of the eleven supplied entries against existing responsibilities and incorporate only useful reusable contributions.
- REQ-02: Adapt prototype-specific layout/QA/handoff into native Iced guidance without copying Ox policy, fixed quotas or unavailable script dependencies.
- REQ-03: Preserve the existing 31-skill profile and historical entry bytes; update discovery and operational references without compulsory activation.
- AC-01 → REQ-01: Inspect a complete candidate matrix with concrete contributions, overlap, disposition and destination.
- AC-02 → REQ-02: Exercise the adapted methods on the workbench consumer and inspect their state/keyboard/theme/provenance outputs; distinguish method use from product acceptance.
- AC-03 → REQ-03: Validate skill metadata/links and exact bounded predecessor handling; unknown mutations remain rejected and older records are unchanged.
